          "caption": "Pwllheli Station An Arriva Wales train stands in the terminus station on arrival from Machynlleth. On departure it will travel through to Birmingham New Street, having joined with a train from Aberystwyth at Machynlleth. The total journey time to Birmingham is not far short of 5 hours.",
